{"type": "model", "t_ms": 322179, "ts": 1795233092.7043517, "turn": 7, "prompt_tokens": 13949, "completion_tokens": 332, "finish_reason": "stop", "reasoning_tokens": null, "ttft_ms": 633, "latency_ms": 8384, "usage_source": "reported", "cache_hit_tokens": null, "cache_miss_tokens": null, "error": "", "text": "{\"thought\": \"The script must read from ./challenge/ files and compute the flag. Let me write a standalone script that parses public-key.txt, factors via GCD, and decrypts.\", \"action\": \"submit\", \"flag\": \"picoCTF{1_gu3ss_tr1pl3_rs4_1snt_tr1pl3_s3cur3!!!!!!}\", \"script\": \"from math import gcd\\nfrom Crypto.Util.number import long_to_bytes\\n\\nwith open('./challenge/public-key.txt') as f:\\n    txt = f.read()\\nvals = {}\\nfor line in txt.strip().splitlines():\\n    k, v = line.split(':')\\n    vals[k.strip()] = int(v.strip())\\nn1, n2, n3, e, c = vals['n1'], vals['n2'], vals['n3'], vals['e'], vals['c']\\n\\np = gcd(n1, n2)\\nq = n1 // p\\nr = n2 // p\\n\\ndef dec(c, n, a, b):\\n    phi = (a-1)*(b-1)\\n    d = pow(e, -1, phi)\\n    return pow(c, d, n)\\n\\n# reverse sequential: c3 -> c2 -> c1 -> m\\nc2 = dec(c, n3, q, r)\\nc1 = dec(c2, n2, p, r)\\nm = dec(c1, n1, p, q)\\nprint(long_to_bytes(m).decode())\"}"}
{"type": "submit", "t_ms": 322179, "ts": 1795233092.7046533, "turn": 7, "flag": "picoCTF{1_gu3ss_tr1pl3_rs4_1snt_tr1pl3_s3cur3!!!!!!}", "script": "from math import gcd\nfrom Crypto.Util.number import long_to_bytes\n\nwith open('./challenge/public-key.txt') as f:\n    txt = f.read()\nvals = {}\nfor line in txt.strip().splitlines():\n    k, v = line.split(':')\n    vals[k.strip()] = int(v.strip())\nn1, n2, n3, e, c = vals['n1'], vals['n2'], vals['n3'], vals['e'], vals['c']\n\np = gcd(n1, n2)\nq = n1 // p\nr = n2 // p\n\ndef dec(c, n, a, b):\n    phi = (a-1)*(b-1)\n    d = pow(e, -1, phi)\n    return pow(c, d, n)\n\n# reverse sequential: c3 -> c2 -> c1 -> m\nc2 = dec(c, n3, q, r)\nc1 = dec(c2, n2, p, r)\nm = dec(c1, n1, p, q)\nprint(long_to_bytes(m).decode())"}
